        "original_id": "85413064-214b-52dc-b487-16ddfc439d07",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: U2\n- Events: U2 360° Tour, Lungs Tour\n- Places: Barcelona\n- Concepts: live performances, in-the-round staging, tour support\n\nFacts:\n- The U2 360° Tour was a worldwide concert tour by the rock band U2.\n- The U2 360° Tour concerts used an in-the-round format on a circular stage, allowing the audience to surround U2 on all sides.\n- U2 did not perform the song \"Electrical Storm\" live until 2 July 2009, when the band played it at the second Barcelona concert of the U2 360° Tour.\n- In 2011, an act associated with the Lungs Tour also supported U2 on the U2 360° Tour.",
